---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Home" description="Couples, stepfamily and individual counselling with Rachel Glover, RCC. In person in Victoria, BC, and by secure video across BC. Free 15-minute consultation.">

  <div class="wrap">
    <section class="b1-hero">
      <div class="copy">
        <p class="eyebrow rise" style="--d:.1s">Victoria · Virtual across BC</p>
        <h1 class="b-h1"><span class="mask"><span style="--d:.25s">Two people.</span></span><span class="mask acc"><span style="--d:.45s">One way forward.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="lede rise" style="--d:.8s">Every couple wants to feel close, and every couple has differences that create conflict. It doesn’t have to be one or the other. I’m Rachel Glover, RCC, and I can help.</p>
        <div class="rise" style="--d:.95s;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free 15-minute consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/fees">Fees &amp; sessions</a></div>
      </div>
      <svg class="b1-forms" viewBox="0 0 116 80" aria-hidden="true">
        <g class="l"><circle cx="40" cy="40" r="36" fill="#CDB792"/></g>
        <circle class="mid" cx="76" cy="40" r="36" clip-path="url(#clipB)" fill="#5C1A26"/>
        <g class="r"><circle cx="76" cy="40" r="35.3" fill="none" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="1.4"/></g>
      </svg>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="band alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="reveal" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;max-width:760px"><p class="eyebrow">How I can help</p><h2 class="b-h1" style="font-size:clamp(36px,4.4vw,60px)">Practical support for the relationships that matter most.</h2></div>
      <div class="b1-cards stagger">
        <a class="b1-card" href="/couples"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 116 80"><use href="#markB"/></svg><h3>Couples counselling</h3><p>We’ll look at the patterns you’ve fallen into and learn practical ways to work through problems as a team.</p><span class="more">Learn more <span>→</span></span></a>
        <a class="b1-card" href="/stepfamilies"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 116 80"><circle cx="30" cy="40" r="24" fill="#CDB792"/><circle cx="58" cy="40" r="24" fill="none" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="86" cy="40" r="24" fill="none" stroke="#655247" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg><h3>Stepfamily support</h3><p>Blending two households is hard on everyone. Support for stepparents, partners and the family you’re building.</p><span class="more">Learn more <span>→</span></span></a>
        <a class="b1-card" href="/individuals"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 116 80"><circle cx="58" cy="40" r="34" fill="none" stroke="#5C1A26" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="58" cy="40" r="20" fill="#CDB792"/></svg><h3>Individual counselling</h3><p>The patterns we carry show up in every relationship. One-to-one space to understand yours.</p><span class="more">Learn more <span>→</span></span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="b1-about">
    <div class="photo slide-up"><img src="/img/rachel-chair.jpg" alt="Rachel Glover, RCC, seated in an armchair in her office" style="object-position:50% 8%" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="txt reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Rachel</p>
      <h2 class="b-h1">Warm, direct, and on your side.</h2>
      <p class="body">I’m a Registered Clinical Counsellor working with couples, stepfamilies and individuals in Victoria and across BC. My role is to help you understand what’s happening, see it differently, and learn better ways to handle it.</p>
      <div><a class="btn ghost light" href="/about">More about me <span class="arr">→</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="reveal"><p class="eyebrow">How it starts</p></div>
      <div class="b1-steps stagger">
        <div class="b1-step"><span class="n">STEP 1</span><h3>Free 15-minute call</h3><p class="body">A short call to see whether I’m the right fit. No pressure.</p></div>
        <div class="b1-step"><span class="n">STEP 2</span><h3>First session</h3><p class="body">We map out what’s happening and what you want to be different.</p></div>
        <div class="b1-step"><span class="n">STEP 3</span><h3>Ongoing sessions</h3><p class="body">In person at Kings Rd, or by secure video anywhere in BC.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band dark">
    <div class="wrap b1-close reveal">
      <h2 class="b-h1">Let’s talk. <span>The first call is free.</span></h2>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn light-fill" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free consultation <span class="arr">→</span></a><a class="btn ghost" href="/contact#qform">Ask a question</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
